!Name: heisenburp-46
!CPeriod 46 pure heisenburp device
!CDetects and duplicates a stream of gliders without
!Cinfluencing it, even temporarily. The reaction used
!Ccan work for any period 35 or greater.
!CJason Summers, 29-Jun-1999
